The audit completed read-only (FR-06…FR-09). Output is the single JSON above. Summary: 45 original questions total, 41 in scope (4 excluded as 1С: L14, C22, C27, C28); classification 25 complete / 14 partial / 2 absent / 0 unclear / 0 conflicts. A separate questionnaire was produced for the 16 unresolved in-scope points (7 лиды, 9 сделки), each linked back to its matrix row. Both HTML documents are standalone Russian, mobile-readable, asset-free, and escape source text. Evidence coverage conclusion: the owner did not ask every question; `t12` and `C5` were not asked (absent ≠ unanswered), and several asked questions (t1/t5/t8/t10/t13/t15; C2/C3/C6/C9/C18/C21/C23/C26) remain partially or wholly open. No code was read or modified; secrets and other projects were not opened.
